## Integration acceptance

- Verify view/edit modes cannot confuse navigation, configuration changes and device actions.
- Exercise missing targets, invalid configuration, unsaved edits and theme switching without changing saved card data.
- Record the actual keyboard movement/resize result for the installed frontend and any unresolved native limitation.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

